            "cls": "framer-wzs2md",
            "name": "The Redesigned Logo Merges An Ampersand With An \"S,\" Symbolizing Unity And Simon & Schuster's Role In Connecting Diverse Genres, Authors, And Media. Using The PP Editorial New Typeface, It Achieves An Elegant, Classic, Yet Modern Look. The Logo Works Standalone, With Type, Or As A Stamp Mark, And Pairs With Author Autographs For Unique Collaboration Lockups.",
